1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,809
It comes in two forms.

2
00:00:01,809 --> 00:00:07,382
Fibres are very long, narrow cells with pointed ends, in bundles.

3
00:00:07,382 --> 00:00:18,997
Jute, flax and hemp are fibres from the phloem, and so is allo, the Himalayan nettle, whose fibres are woven into cloth in Sankhuwasabha and Bajhang.

